osm-road-packs

Code: MIT License, see LICENSE.

Data: the road packs (*.orpk files attached to releases) contain data from
OpenStreetMap.

  Data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors
  Available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Country extracts are downloaded from Geofabrik (https://download.geofabrik.de/).

The packs are a Derivative Database under the ODbL. If you publicly use a pack
or a database derived from it, you must attribute OpenStreetMap as above and
offer the derived database under the ODbL. This repository's builder (the code
that produces the packs from the extract) is published alongside, so every
pack can be reproduced from its source extract.

Note: the golden test packs are built from synthetic, hand-written coordinates
and contain no OpenStreetMap data.
